{"segs": ["PA_ja_127:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_127:0.2", "PA_ja_127:0.3"], "en": "The First Collection (Ekakanipāta), Chapter on the Reed (Kusanāḷivagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_127:0.4"], "en": "7. The Kalaṇḍuka Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_127:1.1", "PA_ja_127:1.2"], "en": "“Those are the lands and those are the sites, and I am one whose range is the forest.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_127:1.3"], "en": "\"Having investigated it, they would surely take it;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_127:1.4"], "en": "drink the milk, O *kalaṇḍuka*!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_127:2.1"], "en": "Thus ends the seventh Jātaka, the *Kalaṇḍuka-jātaka*.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
